;    1: TDecorate(count=12, unk2=6413008, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=512, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=877, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=978, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=590, unk2=16757864, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=10, unk2=5265653, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=5, unk2=13464750, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=14, unk2=16777215, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=10, unk2=8388863, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=12, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=うの, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=12, unk2=65280, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=あき, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   14: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ぼうぜん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=5809, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=5281, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\電車進行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\電車昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Tomorrow, <STYLE ID="1">Dad's</STYLE> thirteenth-year memorial service would be held in the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The ones with me now were my best friend <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> and my cute junior <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was the first time the three of us had ever gone outside the prefecture together.<PG>
At first, I'd meant for them to come visit <STYLE ID="1">Dad's</STYLE> family home just for fun, like a little trip.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But―<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, heard anything from </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I still can't reach her at all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Up to then she'd been keeping me posted, point by point, on what she'd looked into and what she'd found out, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I see..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> family doesn't know where she went either?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> both say the last time they saw </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> was yesterday evening. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I know she'd been in the storehouse the whole time, poring over the books, but vanishing all of a sudden like that..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Is it my fault...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh? Why would it be </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> fault...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Because I asked her to go to Arata early and look into things..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hearing that, <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> and I sighed at the same time.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... Taking all the blame on </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">yourself</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">? You idiot."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"That's right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> gave </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> the best advice there was."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> must know that much herself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But what <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> is feeling isn't so much responsibility as plain worry for <STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE> has been missing since last night.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">The day before that</STYLE>, the day before yesterday, April 5<STYLE ID="8">―</STYLE>when <STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE> got to Arata, we talked on the phone for the first time in a while.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah... hello...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">? It's been a while."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh, it's just </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. I was wondering who it was..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... You didn't have my number saved?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"No, I just switched to a new phone the other day. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">My numbers didn't transfer over right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Oh, didn't you ask </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> how to do it?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh!? How do </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> know about </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was when I first learned about the curse-killings.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And also that <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> had gone to Tokyo.<PG>
But even hearing all that, I couldn't believe it right away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE> had cut off <STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san's</STYLE> head, <STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE> had killed five people, and then that turned out to be a misunderstanding.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> apparently thought the cause was 'someone' lurking in Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It took an hour to hear everything <STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE> had to tell me.<PG>
The whole time I was listening, I paced around the house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It just wasn't something I could listen to calmly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Pointlessly wiping things down and cleaning the toilet as I listened.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the moment <STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE> finished talking, I sank deep into the sofa.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I figure that's all true, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Was that okay? Telling me all this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... What I was worried about was whether that urge to kill would be aimed at </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">But it looks like my precognition really doesn't work in Arata this year. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">So I think it'll be fine even if I meet </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I see. So there's no need to hide it anymore."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Let me fill you in on how things stand in the settlement right now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">No one knows we're investigating the curse-killings. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">The only ones who know are </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Oh, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> parents."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh... now that you mention it, something about it being dangerous for </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> parents to come..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Apparently, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> originally asked </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> parents for their help. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Then it seems </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> said, through her precognition, that it would be dangerous for her parents to go to Arata. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">So it was settled that </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> would come instead."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"So for now, once we're in Arata, I just play dumb about the curse-killings, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　But there's something weird about that too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Weird?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> were convinced you'd killed five people, but you're trying awfully hard to solve it, or how do I put it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Something just doesn't sit right with me about the way </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you're</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> acting."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... Well, that's because I only started moving to solve it at the start of this year. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">By then, the curse-killings were already out of my hands, you know?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"No, that's not what I mean. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">At the start of this year, at least, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> still thought you'd killed five people, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Solving the case would be the same thing as </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> turning yourself in, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Isn't that kind of weird?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... I see. Setting out to solve a case I caused myself certainly is a contradiction."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, if it's a settlement where that many strange things keep happening, maybe you should be a little more..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... </STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="5">Am I myself a contradiction...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey, what's wrong?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> told me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">That this case would always run into a contradiction, and the cause would be something common sense couldn't conceive of. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">And that I should keep asking 'why' over and over to dig into why it turns out that way."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey now, what are you talking about...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, sorry, there's something I want to look into. I'm hanging up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\電話切れる.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
All that came from the other end of the line now was a flat electronic tone.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
As for that conversation with <STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, I'd told <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>, and <STYLE ID="10">Mom</STYLE> about it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After hearing it, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> had apparently been getting in touch with <STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE> every few hours.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She said the last time she'd gotten through to her was last night.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\電車進行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\電車昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, was there anything different about </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> up through yesterday?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"She seemed a little tired. I think she was probably going through the books without sleeping. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">What's more, the books were apparently all written in classical Japanese and Portuguese, so deciphering them seemed to be giving her a lot of trouble. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">She sent me pictures of some of the pages, and I tried deciphering them on my end too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Did you figure anything out?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\翠眼呪殺.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I found out about 'the Green-Eye Curse-Killing.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Girls born with green eyes, it says, feel a powerful urge to kill toward girls with the same green eyes, or toward anyone who has precognition. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">It apparently happens to green-eyed girls once they have had their first period."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"What's that supposed to mean... That's a full-on supernatural phenomenon..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> wanting to kill me could really happen?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes. Over 400 years ago, the residents began killing one another. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">At first it was apparently a conflict born of mutual distrust, but gradually more and more people turned green-eyed, and they began killing one another―"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"By 'they,' you mean men too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes. It is not limited to a first period. Even men are apparently driven by the urge to kill when bleeding."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I get that that's what </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> urge to kill really was, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">That alone still doesn't show us the whole picture at all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes. We still need some big pieces. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The pieces we need to solve the case."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電車停止.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―And then the train began to slow down gently.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looked like we'd reached Toyotake Station, our last transfer station.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "261" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
