{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
Even <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi's</STYLE> intuition, which we'd relied on until now, seemed to be off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The way <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> had just put it, there might be danger.
