{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Turn back to Motoki-cho...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"We can't rule out the possibility of danger, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Is going all the way there really the constructive thing to do? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
