<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>, and I, along with everyone else around the station, could do nothing but stare <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="ぼうぜん">blankly</STYLE> at that blizzard of cherry petals, one you might even call eerie.<PG>
